# CLAUDE TASK PROMPT GENERATOR (CHRONICLE)

## PURPOSE
Convert vague requests into:
- exact file target
- exact function (if possible)
- minimal diff instruction
- strict execution prompt for Claude

---

## HOW TO USE

You provide:

> TASK: <your issue or feature request>

Then follow output format below.

---

## OUTPUT FORMAT (WHAT THIS GENERATOR PRODUCES)

You will always generate:

### 1. FILE TARGET
The single most relevant file from index.md

### 2. SECONDARY FILES (ONLY IF REQUIRED)
Max 1–2 additional files

### 3. FUNCTION TARGET (IF APPLICABLE)

### 4. CLAUDE PROMPT (FINAL COPY/PASTE BLOCK)

---

## RULES

- ALWAYS use index.md first
- NEVER suggest full system rewrites
- NEVER include more than 3 files total
- ALWAYS prefer one-file fixes
- ALWAYS prefer function-level edits
- DEFAULT to DIFF-ONLY mode

---

## ROUTING LOGIC

### UI BUGS
- calendar / layout → calendar.js + CSS file
- gestures → gestures.js
- diary UI → diary.js

---

### EDITING / TEXT
- diary content → diary.js
- themes → themes.js + themeEditor.js + themes.css

---

### SYNC ISSUES
- ALWAYS start with sync.js
- then check:
  - calendar.js (calendar sync issues)
  - ical.js (import/export issues)

---

### GESTURE ISSUES
- gestures.js ONLY
- unless explicitly proven UI-side issue

---

### NOTIFICATIONS
- notifications.js ONLY

---

### UNDO / STATE BUGS
- undo.js + diary.js

---

## PROMPT TEMPLATE OUTPUT

You must output the final Claude prompt like this:

---

### CLAUDE PROMPT START

Use /docs/index.md and /docs/rules.md

TASK: <user task>

FILE: <target file>

FUNCTION: <function name or "unspecified">

MODE: DIFF-ONLY

RULES:
- Only modify the specified function/file
- No full file rewrites
- No unrelated changes
- Keep changes minimal

ACTION:
Fix the issue described.

### CLAUDE PROMPT END

---

## EXAMPLE

### INPUT

TASK: swipe sometimes doesn't trigger on week view

---

### OUTPUT

FILE: gestures.js  
FUNCTION: detectSwipe()

CLAUDE PROMPT:

Use /docs/index.md and /docs/rules.md

TASK: swipe sometimes doesn't trigger on week view

FILE: gestures.js
FUNCTION: detectSwipe()

MODE: DIFF-ONLY

RULES:
- Only modify detectSwipe
- No other files
- No refactors

ACTION:
Fix swipe detection reliability issue.

---

## CORE PRINCIPLE

You are NOT writing solutions.

You are:
→ routing work to the correct file  
→ minimizing Claude’s search space  
→ enforcing surgical edits only